B.all=new A.ag("\nB) PASSENGERS",null,B.bA,B.C,null,null,null,null,null)
B.N5=A.a(s(["Never get into a vehicle that looks to be in a bad condition.","Never push others while getting in or out of a vehicle.","Never distract the driver with stories.","Never encourage the driver to speed or drive dangerously.","Never sit with your head or arm out of the window because you could be injured by a passing vehicle.","Never hang onto the outside of a vehicle.Never travel on the roof, because it is much more dangerous than inside.Never allow a young child to sit at the front or sit at the front when carrying a baby or young child."]),t.b)
B.D4=new A.dE(B.N5,B.ah,B.b,B.H,B.aJ,null)
B.alk=new A.ag("\nC) MOTORISTS (CARS)",null,B.bA,B.C,null,null,null,null,null)
B.Qz=A.a(s(["Must hold a valid driving permit for the class of vehicle you are driving.","Must be feeling well \u2013 not ill or tired","Must be able to see properly \u2013wear glasses if necessary ","Must wear seat belt, this applies to your passengers too (front and back seats)","Make adjust your seat and mirrors so that you can see all round the vehicle.","Avoid wearing loose footwear, such as sandals and slippers, as these can prevent you controlling the vehicle properly.Must ensure that vehicle is in safe mechanical condition.","Must not overload with passengers or goods.","Must carry out regular safety checks before leaving for any journey."]),t.b)
B.Db=new A.dE(B.Qz,B.ah,B.b,B.H,B.aJ,null)
B.alw=new A.ag("\nD) MOTORCYCLISTS",null,B.bA,B.C,null,null,null,null,null)
B.PG=A.a(s(["Must hold a valid driving permit for this class of vehicle.","Never carry anyone on the petrol tank.","Never wear sandals or slippers.","Never carry heavy or dangerous loads such as glass or allow your passengers too.","Never load passengers in the middle of the road or junction.","Never overtake a vehicle on its left side.","Never squeeze into narrow spaces between vehicles \u2013 the drivers may not see you, and you could be squashed between the vehicles.","Wear bright clothes preferably yellow jackets so that you can be seen."]),t.b)
