B.afE=new A.bk("You just need to look at the picture and interpret in regard to road usage.\n\nNote: For a road user, to interpret they just need CPS [Colour, Picture, and Shape]",null,B.I,B.ah)
B.b6=new A.A(!0,B.b,null,null,null,null,15,null,null,null,4,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
B.afF=new A.bk("Under this section, the learner is expected to have a better understanding of all the road signs, traffic signals.\n\nA learner should know all the road signs including mandatory signs, warning signs, information signs, roadwork signs, road markings and meaning of traffic light colors.\n\nThe IOV may randomly ask you any of the signs. The leaner needs to be well prepared for this section.",null,B.I,B.b6)
B.afH=new A.bk("This consists of headlights, brake lights, turn signals and interior lights.\n\nIt helps the driver to see and ensures the vehicle is visible to others while on the road.",null,B.I,B.b6)
B.afI=new A.bk("MEANING OF COLOUR",null,B.I,B.ah)
B.afJ=new A.bk("\nIt is marked by a white painted line.\n\na) White continuous dividing line \n\n --> means no overtaking or changing of lanes.\n\nb) Broken / dotted dividing line \n\n --> It means that you may overtake or change lanes if the road is clear/ safe.",null,B.I,B.aL)
B.afK=new A.bk("This consists of fuel tank, fuel pump, fuel filter and Injection.\n\nIt is responsible for storing and circulating fuel to the engine.",null,B.I,B.b6)
B.afL=new A.bk("This consists of the radiator, water pump, coolant, thermostat, fan.\n\nIt keeps the engine from overheating to ensure smooth operation and longevity.",null,B.I,B.b6)
B.aW=new A.A(!0,B.b,null,null,null,null,17,B.v,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
B.afN=new A.bk("\n*Rules for angle parking*",null,B.I,B.aW)
B.afO=new A.bk("This consists of battery, wires, fuses and alternator.\n\nThe battery supplies electrical energy to all parts of a vehicle and the alternator charges the battery while the car is running.",null,B.I,B.b6)
B.afP=new A.bk("This shape represents information or facility or guiding signs.",null,B.I,B.ah)
B.afQ=new A.bk("\nThese are also known as facility signs.\n\nThese signs are used to guide road users along routes, inform them about destination and distance, identify points of geographical and historical interest and provide other information that will make the road travel easier, safe and pleasant.",null,B.I,B.aL)
B.Bh=new A.bk("Also known as crosswalks, are designated areas for pedestrians to safely cross roads, and they come in various types, including zebra, pelican, puffin, toucan, and pegasus crossings.",null,B.I,B.aL)
B.d_=new A.A(!0,B.b,null,null,null,null,17,null,null,null,4,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
B.afR=new A.bk("\nUnder this, the learner practically demonstrates their driving skills to the IOV.\n\nThe learner should pass the designated routes as instructed without knocking the barriers.\n\nKindly avoid panicking. Panic can easily lead you into mistakes and crashing.",null,B.I,B.d_)
B.afS=new A.bk("This shape represents Mandatory signs if it is in blue colour or Regulatory signs if it is in red colour.",null,B.I,B.ah)
B.afT=new A.bk("These are questions that you may not skip. One should get to know this information at their fingerprints otherwise you may be stopped from proceeding with the test.\n\n For example;",null,B.I,B.b6)
B.afU=new A.bk("Under this section, the instructor may assess the learner if he/she is aware of the procedures taken to extend first aid to either oneself or other individuals incase of an accident. \n\nForexample, prioritizing safety by checking the scene for hazards, then assessing yourself and any injured individuals for injuries, calling for help, and providing basic first aid like controlling bleeding and ensuring breathing.etc",null,B.I,B.b6)
B.afV=new A.bk("This consists of springs and shock absorbers. \n\nIt helps in providing comfort during a drive.",null,B.I,B.b6)
B.afW=new A.bk("Car System refers to a collection of interconnected components and subsystems that work together to perform a specific function, such as the engine, transmission, or braking system.",null,B.I,B.b6)
B.Bi=new A.A(!0,B.b,null,null,null,null,15,B.v,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
B.afY=new A.bk("Designed By",null,B.I,B.Bi)
B.agA=new A.bk("\n\nCompany : Shamson Technologies Limited\n\nWebsite : www.shamsontechnologies.com\n\nEmail : info@shamsontechnologies.com\n\nLocation : L5 Majestic plaza William Street, Kampala\n\nContacts: +256(0) 702-715-520 / \n\n +256(0) 776-496-931\n\n\n",null,B.I,B.ah)
B.afG=new A.bk("Inspected By:\n\n",null,B.I,B.Bi)
B.afM=new A.bk("ASP Joseph Akatuhwera \n\nIncharge Driver Testing Centre Naguru.\n\nContact - +256(0) 774-266-449",null,B.I,B.ah)
B.RQ=A.a(s([B.afY,B.agA,B.afG,B.afM]),t.l)
B.afX=new A.bk(null,B.RQ,B.I,null)
B.afZ=new A.bk("Pre-trip inspection helps drivers to remember all the major systems and parts to inspect (check) before heading out on a route.\n\nThis section involves questions about how a driver prepares the vehicle before a trip.\n\nYou may be asked about how you may check lights, mirrors, wipers, steering, tires, brakes, fluid levels, and how to ensure all locks and the engine compartment are in good working order.\n",null,B.I,B.b6)
B.ag_=new A.bk("\n*Rules for parallel parking*",null,B.I,B.aW)
B.ag0=new A.bk("We have 3 major shapes namely;\n\n> Triangular shape \n> Circular shape \n> Rectangular shape",null,B.I,B.ah)
B.ag1=new A.bk("It is important that all road users know how to interpret the any road sign and take right decision.",null,B.I,B.ah)
B.ag2=new A.bk("\n2) Oral Tests.\n\nIn this test, the IOV verbally asks you questions which require immediate short answers.\n\nThe learner is expected to have enough knowledge about basic mechanics, road signs and traffic signals.",null,B.I,B.d_)
B.ag3=new A.bk("Vehicles are required to slow down or stop if necessary and then only proceed if it is safe.",null,B.I,B.aL)
B.ag4=new A.bk("\nThis allows vehicles to travel in both directions on the same roadway.",null,B.I,B.aL)
B.ag5=new A.bk("Here, the IOV wants to test if you know how to use the road and how you should behave while driving.\n\nSome of the questions that you may be tested may include;",null,B.I,B.b6)
B.ag6=new A.bk("This consists of catalytic converter, mufflers and tailpipes.\n\nIt is responsible for guiding away the waste gases from the car safely. It also reduces noise and emissions.",null,B.I,B.b6)
B.ag7=new A.bk("\nIts a place where three or more roads join and traffic must go around a circular area in the middle, rather than straight across.",null,B.I,B.aL)
