B.agc=new A.bk("Under this section, the learner is expected to have a better understanding of all the dashboard lights and warnings and what they meaning.\n\nCommon lights & warnings you should know may include;\n\nCheck engine warning, battery warning, coolant temperature light, transmission temperature, oil pressure warning, tire pressure monitoring system, brake system, airbag warning, lamp out, washer fluid, door open, low fuel, headlights, seatbelt indicator, front fog lights, high-beam indicator, automatic high-beam indicator, automatic emergency braking.",null,B.I,B.b6)
B.agd=new A.bk("There are three (3) main categories of road signs namely;",null,B.I,B.aW)
B.age=new A.bk("\nThese are also known as prohibitory or regulatory signs. \n\n These are signs which are obligatory on the traffic which uses a specific area of road. \n\nThese signs indicate what must one do, rather than must not do. \n\nMandatory Road signs are generally round in shape with red border. \n\nExamples of regulatory signs include stop, yield, do not enter, no turn on left, no turn on right, no parking, weight limit, speed limit, one way and HOV lane ahead. \n\nThey are used to regulate the flow of traffic, regulatory signs are arguably the most important type of traffic signs.\n\nViolation of these signs attracts heavy fines and punishments.",null,B.I,B.aL)
